#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:1
msgid "Adding a New Local Model"
msgstr "添加新的本地模型"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:3
msgid ""
"This guide explains how to register a self-hosted model behind the "
"HybridInference gateway. Use it when the model is already served by a "
"local OpenAI-compatible server such as vLLM, SGLang, Ollama, or your own "
"`/v1/chat/completions` service."
msgstr ""
"本指南说明如何在 HybridInference 网关后面注册一个自建模型。如果模型已经由本地的 OpenAI 兼容服务器提供服务——例如 "
"vLLM、SGLang、Ollama，或你自己的 `/v1/chat/completions` 服务——就用这份指南。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:8
msgid ""
"For remote providers or custom adapters, see [Adding a New Model](adding-"
"models.md)."
msgstr "远程 provider 或自定义 adapter 见[添加新模型](adding-models.md)。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:11
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概览"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:13
msgid "Adding a local model has three parts:"
msgstr "添加一个本地模型分三步："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:15
msgid "Start the local inference server."
msgstr "启动本地推理服务器。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:16
msgid "Add an entry to your model registry that points at that server."
msgstr "在模型注册表中添加一条指向该服务器的条目。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:17
msgid "Restart the gateway and verify through the public `/v1` API."
msgstr "重启网关，并通过公开的 `/v1` API 验证。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:19
msgid ""
"The local server must expose OpenAI-compatible endpoints. The gateway "
"forwards chat requests to `/v1/chat/completions`, and embedding requests "
"to `/v1/embeddings` when the model is registered with `model_type: "
"embedding`."
msgstr ""
"本地服务器必须暴露 OpenAI 兼容的端点。网关把对话请求转发到 `/v1/chat/completions`；当模型以 "
"`model_type: embedding` 注册时，embedding 请求转发到 `/v1/embeddings`。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:23
msgid ""
"**Where your model registry lives.** There is no `config/models.yaml` in "
"this repository. The backend resolves the registry path in "
"`apps/backend/serving/config/distribution.py` with the precedence "
"`MODELS_CONFIG_PATH` → a distribution manifest's `paths.models` (only "
"when `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` names one *and* "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE=active`) → the bundled "
"`config/examples/models.openrouter.yaml`. See [Where your model registry "
"lives](adding-models.md#where-your-model-registry-lives) for the full "
"rules and the two layouts a self-hoster can pick. Below, \"your model "
"registry\" means whichever file that resolution picks."
msgstr ""
"**模型注册表在哪里**。本仓库里没有 `config/models.yaml`。后端在 "
"`apps/backend/serving/config/distribution.py` "
"中按以下优先级解析注册表路径：`MODELS_CONFIG_PATH` → distribution manifest 的 "
"`paths.models`（仅当 `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` 指定了一份 manifest *且* "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE=active` 时）→ 随仓库附带的 "
"`config/examples/models.openrouter.yaml`。完整规则、以及自建者可选的两种布局，见[模型注册表在哪里"
"](adding-models.md#where-your-model-registry-"
"lives)。下文说的「模型注册表」，指的就是这套解析最终选中的那个文件。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:33
msgid "Private Server (No Public Internet)"
msgstr "私有服务器（不接公网）"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:35
msgid ""
"If your model runs on a different machine that is not exposed to the "
"public internet, keep it private and let the gateway reach it over a "
"trusted network path."
msgstr "如果模型跑在另一台不对公网暴露的机器上，就让它保持私有，由网关通过可信的网络路径访问它。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:39
msgid "Point the route at the private address:"
msgstr "把路由指向私有地址："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:49
msgid "Or forward the port to the gateway host with an SSH reverse tunnel:"
msgstr "或者用 SSH 反向隧道把端口转发到网关主机："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:56
msgid "Then the route target is a loopback address on the gateway host:"
msgstr "这样路由的目标就是网关主机上的一个回环地址："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:62
msgid ""
"For reverse-tunnel setups, verify from the gateway host before changing "
"any gateway config:"
msgstr "使用反向隧道时，先在网关主机上验证，再去改网关配置："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:69
msgid "Step 1: Start the Local Model Server"
msgstr "第 1 步：启动本地模型服务器"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:71
msgid "Start the model with your preferred serving runtime. Example with vLLM:"
msgstr "用你惯用的推理运行时启动模型。以 vLLM 为例："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:80
msgid "Check that the local server responds before touching the gateway config:"
msgstr "在动网关配置之前，先确认本地服务器有响应："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:93
msgid ""
"Local inference servers usually do not require an API key, which is why "
"these two calls carry no `Authorization` header. The gateway's own API "
"does — see [Step 5](#step-5-verify-through-the-gateway)."
msgstr ""
"本地推理服务器通常不需要 API key，所以上面这两个调用都没有带 `Authorization` 头。网关自己的 API 则需要——见[第 5"
" 步](#step-5-verify-through-the-gateway)。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:97
msgid ""
"If the gateway runs in Docker, use `http://host.docker.internal:<port>` "
"in your registry so the container can reach the host. If it runs directly"
" on the host, `http://localhost:<port>` is fine."
msgstr ""
"如果网关跑在 Docker 里，注册表中要用 "
"`http://host.docker.internal:<port>`，容器才能访问宿主机。如果网关直接跑在宿主机上，用 "
"`http://localhost:<port>` 即可。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:101
msgid "Step 2: Add the Model to Your Registry"
msgstr "第 2 步：把模型加进注册表"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:103
msgid ""
"Add a new entry under `models:`. Keep the public `id` short and stable, "
"because clients send it in the `model` field."
msgstr "在 `models:` 下新增一条条目。公开的 `id` 要短、要稳定，因为客户端会在 `model` 字段里发送它。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:136
msgid "Use these fields carefully:"
msgstr "这几个字段要小心填写："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:138
msgid "`id`: Public model ID returned by `/v1/models` and used by clients."
msgstr "`id`：`/v1/models` 返回、客户端使用的公开模型 id。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:139
msgid ""
"`provider`: Top-level provider label for metadata, and the default "
"`route[].kind` when no `route:` list is given. For local OpenAI-"
"compatible servers, use `vllm`, `sglang`, `ollama`, or `openai_compat`."
msgstr ""
"`provider`：用作元数据的顶层 provider 标签；在没有给出 `route:` 列表时，它也是默认的 "
"`route[].kind`。本地 OpenAI 兼容服务器用 `vllm`、`sglang`、`ollama` 或 "
"`openai_compat`。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:142
msgid ""
"`route[].kind`: Adapter kind used by the gateway. Local OpenAI-compatible"
" services can use `vllm`, `sglang`, `ollama`, or `openai_compat`."
msgstr ""
"`route[].kind`：网关使用的 adapter 类型。本地 OpenAI 兼容服务可以用 "
"`vllm`、`sglang`、`ollama` 或 `openai_compat`。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:144
msgid ""
"`base_url`: The local server root. It may include `/v1`, but does not "
"have to."
msgstr "`base_url`：本地服务器的根地址。可以带 `/v1`，但不是必须。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:145
msgid ""
"`provider_model_id`: Model name sent to the local server. It must match "
"the serving runtime's model name (vLLM's `--served-model-name`, the "
"Ollama tag, and so on)."
msgstr ""
"`provider_model_id`：发给本地服务器的模型名。它必须与推理运行时的模型名一致（vLLM 的 `--served-model-"
"name`、Ollama 的 tag，等等）。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:148
msgid ""
"`aliases`: Optional extra public names that resolve to the same gateway "
"model. They must not collide with another model's `id` or aliases — a "
"duplicate resolves to whichever model loads last, and the backend logs a "
"warning."
msgstr ""
"`aliases`：可选的额外公开名称，解析到同一个网关模型。它们不能与另一个模型的 `id` "
"或别名冲突——重名会解析到最后加载的那个模型，后端会记一条警告。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:151
msgid "`supported_params`: Only include parameters the local runtime accepts."
msgstr "`supported_params`：只填本地运行时接受的参数。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:152
msgid ""
"`route[].provider`: Optional analytics label override — see [Naming a "
"Route in the Dashboard](#naming-a-route-in-the-dashboard)."
msgstr ""
"`route[].provider`：可选的分析标签覆盖——见[在仪表盘中给路由命名](#naming-a-route-in-the-"
"dashboard)。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:154
msgid ""
"`route[].provider_display_name`: Optional human-readable name for that "
"label."
msgstr "`route[].provider_display_name`：该标签可选的可读名称。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:156
msgid ""
"The full field reference, including everything a route entry accepts, is "
"in [Adding a New Model](adding-models.md#configuration-reference)."
msgstr ""
"完整的字段参考（包括一条路由条目接受的全部内容）见[添加新模型](adding-models.md#configuration-"
"reference)。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:159
msgid "Naming a Route in the Dashboard"
msgstr "在仪表盘中给路由命名"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:161
msgid ""
"By default a route reports its `kind` as the provider label, and that "
"label is what `api_logs.provider` records and what every provider-scoped "
"admin view groups on: Token Usage, Provider Performance, Provider "
"Observability, the provider disable switch, and the provider registry. "
"Two local boxes both served by `kind: vllm` therefore land in one row and"
" cannot be compared."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，一条路由把自己的 `kind` 作为 provider 标签上报；`api_logs.provider` 记录的就是这个标签，所有按 "
"provider 划分的管理视图也都以它分组：Token Usage、Provider Performance、Provider "
"Observability、provider 禁用开关，以及 provider 注册表。因此两台都由 `kind: vllm` "
"提供服务的本地机器会落在同一行里，无法互相比较。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:167
msgid ""
"Give each route its own label to split them, and optionally a display "
"name:"
msgstr "给每条路由各自的标签就能把它们拆开，还可以再给一个显示名："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:185
msgid ""
"The dashboard then shows `Local box A · local-a` and `Local box B · "
"local-b` as separate providers, each with its own error rate, cache-hit "
"rate, token totals, and enable/disable switch."
msgstr ""
"仪表盘随后会把 `Local box A · local-a` 和 `Local box B · local-b` 显示为两个独立的 "
"provider，各自有自己的错误率、缓存命中率、token 总量和启用/禁用开关。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:189
msgid ""
"Only the analytics label changes. The route still talks to the upstream "
"its `kind` selects, `endpoint_id` is still derived from the model id and "
"the route's base URL, and API keys stay pooled under the kind — so one "
"`LOCAL_API_KEY` continues to serve both boxes."
msgstr ""
"变的只有分析标签。路由仍然与它的 `kind` 所选的上游通信，`endpoint_id` 仍由模型 id 和该路由的 base URL "
"推导，API key 仍按 kind 汇集在一起——所以一个 `LOCAL_API_KEY` 依然同时服务两台机器。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:194
msgid "Rules and caveats:"
msgstr "规则与注意事项："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:196
msgid ""
"The label must be lowercase letters, numbers, dashes, or underscores (max"
" 64 characters), and may not borrow a built-in provider's name (`vllm`, "
"`zai`, `openrouter`, …). Reusing one would fold this route's traffic into"
" that provider's quota reporting and disable switch. A malformed or "
"reserved label raises during the registry load, so the backend comes up "
"with an incomplete model list — logged as `Failed to load models.yaml` — "
"rather than silently mislabelling traffic."
msgstr ""
"标签只能由小写字母、数字、短横线或下划线组成（最多 64 个字符），并且不能借用内置 provider "
"的名字（`vllm`、`zai`、`openrouter` 等）。借用会把这条路由的流量并进那个 provider "
"的配额统计和禁用开关。格式非法或占用保留名的标签会在加载注册表时抛错，于是后端起来时模型列表是不完整的——日志里记为 `Failed to "
"load models.yaml`——而不是悄悄给流量贴错标签。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:203
msgid ""
"`provider_display_name` works on its own too, if you want to rename a "
"provider in the dashboard without splitting it."
msgstr "`provider_display_name` 也可以单独使用：只想在仪表盘里给某个 provider 改名、而不拆分它时。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:205
msgid ""
"A label reserves its slug against custom providers created in the "
"Providers tab. If a custom provider with that slug already exists, the "
"custom provider keeps its keys and route target and the clash is logged "
"as an error at startup — rename the label, since otherwise both report "
"under one provider."
msgstr ""
"标签会针对 Providers 标签页中创建的自定义 provider 预占这个 slug。如果同 slug 的自定义 provider "
"已经存在，那么自定义 provider 保留它的 key 和路由目标，冲突会在启动时记为一条 error——请给标签改名，否则两者会汇报到同一个 "
"provider 名下。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:209
msgid ""
"Renaming does not rewrite history. Rows already written under the old "
"label keep it, so both labels appear until the old data ages out of "
"`provider_hourly_stats` (purged at 30 days) — expect a gap in the new "
"label's charts right after the rename."
msgstr ""
"改名不会重写历史。已经以旧标签写入的数据行仍保留旧标签，因此两个标签会同时出现，直到旧数据从 `provider_hourly_stats` "
"中过期（30 天清理）——改名之后，新标签的图表会有一段空档。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:213
msgid ""
"Per-model route weight overrides key on `endpoint_id`, not the label, so "
"a rename leaves them intact."
msgstr "按模型的路由权重覆盖以 `endpoint_id` 为键，而不是标签，所以改名不会动到它们。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:216
msgid "Step 3: Add Optional Remote Fallbacks"
msgstr "第 3 步：添加可选的远程回退"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:218
msgid "For automatic fallback, add another route with a lower or equal weight:"
msgstr "要实现自动回退，再加一条权重更低或相等的路由："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:239
msgid ""
"Set a fallback's `weight` to `0` to keep the route configured but "
"unselected. Set it above `0` to allow weighted routing and failover. "
"`config/examples/models.openrouter.yaml` ships a working local-first "
"hybrid entry built exactly this way."
msgstr ""
"把回退路由的 `weight` 设为 `0`，可以让它保持配置但不被选中；设为大于 `0` "
"则允许按权重路由和故障切换。`config/examples/models.openrouter.yaml` "
"里就带了一条完全按这种方式写成、可直接使用的本地优先混合条目。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:244
msgid "Step 4: Restart the Gateway"
msgstr "第 4 步：重启网关"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:246
msgid ""
"Restart the backend so it reloads the registry. With the bundled Docker "
"Compose setup:"
msgstr "重启 backend，让它重新加载注册表。使用仓库自带的 Docker Compose 时："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:253
msgid "For local development without Docker, start it directly:"
msgstr "本地开发不用 Docker 时，直接启动："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:261
msgid ""
"At startup the backend logs `Registered N routes from <path>`. That line "
"is the fastest way to confirm which registry file it actually loaded."
msgstr "启动时后端会记录 `Registered N routes from <path>`。这一行是确认它实际加载了哪个注册表文件最快的办法。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:264
msgid "Step 5: Verify Through the Gateway"
msgstr "第 5 步：通过网关验证"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:266
msgid ""
"List registered models. `GET /v1/models` accepts an anonymous request — "
"it resolves an API key only to decide whether to include admin-visible "
"entries:"
msgstr "列出已注册的模型。`GET /v1/models` 接受匿名请求——它解析 API key 只是为了决定要不要包含仅管理员可见的条目："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:273
msgid ""
"`POST /v1/chat/completions` goes through `verify_api_key`, so **it "
"returns 401 without a valid gateway API key** unless the backend runs "
"with `USER_AUTH_ENABLED=false`. This is the key issued by your gateway, "
"not the local server's:"
msgstr ""
"`POST /v1/chat/completions` 会走 `verify_api_key`，所以**没有有效的网关 API key 时它返回 "
"401**，除非后端以 `USER_AUTH_ENABLED=false` 运行。这里用的是你的网关签发的 key，不是本地服务器的 key："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:291
msgid "Test streaming:"
msgstr "测试流式："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:305
msgid "Routing Notes"
msgstr "路由说明"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:307
msgid ""
"When a routing config file is present, `RoutingManager` can adjust route "
"weights after models are registered. Its path resolves the same way the "
"registry does — `ROUTING_CONFIG_PATH`, then a manifest's `paths.routing`,"
" then `config/examples/routing.minimal.yaml`. Without one, the gateway "
"uses the weights written in the model registry. See [Routing "
"Configuration](routing.md)."
msgstr ""
"存在路由配置文件时，`RoutingManager` 可以在模型注册之后调整路由权重。它的路径解析方式与注册表相同——先 "
"`ROUTING_CONFIG_PATH`，再 manifest 的 `paths.routing`，最后 "
"`config/examples/routing.minimal.yaml`。没有这个文件时，网关使用模型注册表里写的权重。见[路由配置](routing.md)。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:313
msgid "Prioritizing Decode on an sglang Route"
msgstr "在 sglang 路由上优先调度 decode"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:315
msgid ""
"A route whose server was started with sglang's `--enable-priority-"
"scheduling` can declare that, and the gateway will stamp a per-request "
"`priority` on the upstream body so a mega-prefill is scheduled behind "
"interactive traffic rather than ahead of it:"
msgstr ""
"如果一条路由指向的服务器是带 sglang 的 `--enable-priority-scheduling` "
"启动的，就可以声明这一点，网关会在发往上游的请求体上逐请求打上 `priority`，让超大 prefill 排在交互流量之后，而不是之前："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:336
msgid ""
"Priority is derived from the estimated *un-cached* prefill — the prompt "
"size minus the prefix this endpoint is expected to have cached. The three"
" tiers default to interactive 20, large 15, elephant 0 "
"(`apps/backend/routing/prefill_load.py`), and clients cannot set their "
"own: a `priority` field in a client request body is dropped by "
"`validate_params`. Both `/v1/chat/completions` and `/v1/messages` stamp "
"it. A model on `router: routewise` keeps the upstream's default priority "
"instead, because that router has no prefill accounting to compute the "
"discount from — so `priority_scheduling: true` is inert there."
msgstr ""
"优先级由估算出的*未命中缓存*的 prefill 推导得出——即 prompt 大小减去该端点预计已缓存的前缀。三个档位的默认值是 "
"interactive 20、large 15、elephant "
"0（`apps/backend/routing/prefill_load.py`），客户端不能自己设置：客户端请求体里的 `priority` "
"字段会被 `validate_params` 丢弃。`/v1/chat/completions` 和 `/v1/messages` "
"都会打上它。使用 `router: routewise` 的模型则保留上游的默认优先级，因为该 router 没有 prefill "
"记账、算不出这个折扣——所以 `priority_scheduling: true` 在那里是不起作用的。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:346
msgid ""
"Set it only on routes pointing at a server launched with the flag. A "
"server without it ignores the field, but a remote provider that validates"
" its request body strictly would not."
msgstr "只在指向带该 flag 启动的服务器的路由上设置它。没带该 flag 的服务器会忽略这个字段，但严格校验请求体的远程 provider 不会。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:350
msgid "Recording a Prefix-Cache Miss on an sglang Route"
msgstr ""
"在 sglang 路由上记录前缀缓存未命中"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:352
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"An sglang server started with `--enable-cache-report` answers a prefix-"
"cache **miss** with `\"prompt_tokens_details\": null` rather than "
"`{\"cached_tokens\": 0}`. Left alone, the gateway reads that null as "
"\"this provider says nothing about caching\" and stores `NULL` in "
"`api_logs.cache_read_tokens` — the same value it stores for a provider "
"that cannot report at all, so a measured miss disappears from any hit-"
"rate denominator computed off that column."
msgstr ""
"带 `--enable-cache-report` 启动的 sglang 服务器，对前缀缓存**未命中**的应答是 `\"prompt_tokens_details\": null`，而不是 `{\"cached_tokens\": 0}`。不加处理的话，网关会把这个 null 读成「这个 provider 对缓存只字未提」，于是往 `api_logs.cache_read_tokens` 里存 `NULL`——和一个根本无法上报的 provider 存的是同一个值，于是一次实测到的未命中，会从任何基于该列计算的命中率分母里消失。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:360
msgid ""
"A route can declare that its server does report, which turns the null "
"into the 0 it means:"
msgstr ""
"路由可以声明自己的服务器确实会上报，从而把这个 null 变回它真正代表的 0："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:373
msgid ""
"**Verify before setting it.** The null is ambiguous: sglang *without* "
"`--enable-cache-report`, and vLLM without `--enable-prompt-tokens-"
"details`, send the identical null on every request — hit or miss ([vllm-"
"project/vllm#44377](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/44377)). "
"Declaring the flag there would replace an honest `NULL` with a fabricated"
" \"measured miss\", which is harder to notice later than the missing "
"value it replaces. The check is one cold request and one warm repeat of "
"the same prompt against the endpoint:"
msgstr ""
"**设置之前先验证**。这个 null 是有歧义的：*没有* `--enable-cache-report` 的 sglang，以及没有 `--enable-prompt-tokens-details` 的 vLLM，对每一个请求都发同一个 null——命中未命中都一样（[vllm-project/vllm#44377](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/44377)）。在那种服务器上声明这个 flag，等于把一个诚实的 `NULL` 换成一个编造出来的「实测未命中」，而后者比它替换掉的那个缺失值更难在事后被察觉。验证方法是对该端点发一次冷请求、再发一次同样 prompt 的热请求："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:386
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Run it twice. The route qualifies only if the second call returns "
"`{\"cached_tokens\": N}` with `N > 0` while the first returned `null`. If"
" both return `null`, the server is not reporting — leave the flag off."
msgstr ""
"跑两次。只有当第二次返回 `{\"cached_tokens\": N}` 且 `N > 0`、而第一次返回 `null` 时，这条路由才算合格。如果两次都返回 `null`，说明服务器并没有在上报——别开这个 flag。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:390
msgid "Two loader rules keep a wrong declaration from passing quietly:"
msgstr ""
"有两条加载器规则，防止一个错误的声明悄悄通过："

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:392
msgid ""
"**Route-level only.** Declaring it on the model (including a shorthand "
"model with no `route:` block) is a config error, because the claim is "
"about one server's startup flags and inheritance would carry it to every "
"fallback."
msgstr ""
"**只能写在路由级**。写在模型上（包括没有 `route:` 块的简写模型）是配置错误，因为这个声明说的是某一台服务器的启动参数，而继承会把它带到每一条回退路由上。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:395
msgid ""
"**Real YAML booleans only.** A quoted `\"false\"` is a config error "
"rather than a surprise opt-in, since `bool(\"false\")` is `True`."
msgstr ""
"**只接受真正的 YAML 布尔值**。带引号的 `\"false\"` 会被判为配置错误，而不是变成一次意外的开启——因为 `bool(\"false\")` 的结果是 `True`。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:398
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"What the client sees differs by surface: a non-streaming response carries"
" `cache_read_tokens: 0` (the `Usage` response model drops the rest), "
"while a streaming final chunk also carries `cached_tokens: 0` and "
"`prompt_tokens_details: {\"cached_tokens\": 0}`. `/v1/messages` reports "
"it as `cache_read_input_tokens: 0`."
msgstr ""
"客户端看到什么取决于接口：非流式响应里带 `cache_read_tokens: 0`（`Usage` 响应模型会丢掉其余字段），而流式的最后一个 chunk 还会带上 `cached_tokens: 0` 和 `prompt_tokens_details: {\"cached_tokens\": 0}`。`/v1/messages` 则把它报成 `cache_read_input_tokens: 0`。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:404
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "排障"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:406
msgid "Model Does Not Appear in `/v1/models`"
msgstr "模型没有出现在 `/v1/models` 中"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:408
msgid ""
"Confirm which registry the backend loaded, from the `Registered N routes "
"from <path>` startup log line. If no registry is found at the resolved "
"path, it logs an error naming that path, `/v1/models` is empty, and every"
" request reports the model as not found."
msgstr ""
"从启动日志的 `Registered N routes from <path>` "
"一行确认后端加载了哪个注册表。如果解析出的路径下找不到注册表，它会记一条 error 并指出该路径，`/v1/models` "
"为空，而且每个请求都会报模型不存在。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:412
msgid "Check YAML indentation under `models:`."
msgstr "检查 `models:` 下的 YAML 缩进。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:413
msgid "Restart the backend after editing the registry."
msgstr "编辑注册表之后要重启后端。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:414
msgid "Confirm `id` and `aliases` do not collide with another model."
msgstr "确认 `id` 和 `aliases` 没有与其他模型冲突。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:415
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A route whose `${VAR}`-backed `api_key`, `api_keys`, or `base_url` "
"resolves to empty drops the whole model; the log names the skipped models"
" and the unset variables. Mark such a route `optional: true` to skip only"
" that route."
msgstr ""
"一条路由中由 `${VAR}` 提供的 `api_key`、`api_keys` 或 `base_url` "
"若解析为空，整个模型都会被丢弃；日志会列出被跳过的模型和未设置的变量。把这条路由标记为 `optional: true`，可以只跳过该路由。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:419
msgid "Gateway Cannot Reach the Local Server"
msgstr "网关访问不到本地服务器"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:421
msgid "From Docker, use `host.docker.internal` instead of `localhost`."
msgstr "在 Docker 里用 `host.docker.internal` 代替 `localhost`。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:422
msgid "From bare metal, use `localhost` or the host IP."
msgstr "在裸机上用 `localhost` 或主机 IP。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:423
msgid ""
"For private remote servers, use a private IP/hostname or a private tunnel"
" endpoint; avoid public internet exposure."
msgstr "私有的远程服务器用私有 IP/主机名或私有隧道端点；不要暴露到公网。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:425
msgid ""
"Confirm the local server listens on `0.0.0.0`, not only `127.0.0.1`, if "
"it has to be reached from a container."
msgstr "如果需要从容器里访问，确认本地服务器监听在 `0.0.0.0`，而不只是 `127.0.0.1`。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:427
msgid ""
"Verify `curl <base_url>/v1/models` works from the same environment as the"
" backend."
msgstr "在与后端相同的环境里验证 `curl <base_url>/v1/models` 能通。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:430
msgid "Requests Fail After Registration"
msgstr "注册之后请求失败"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:432
msgid ""
"Make sure `provider_model_id` matches the model name exposed by the local"
" runtime."
msgstr "确认 `provider_model_id` 与本地运行时对外暴露的模型名一致。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:434
msgid "Remove unsupported request params from `supported_params`."
msgstr "把本地运行时不支持的请求参数从 `supported_params` 里去掉。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:435
msgid ""
"If the runtime's base URL already ends in `/v1`, keep it that way; the "
"adapter appends `/chat/completions` under that base."
msgstr ""
"如果运行时的 base URL 已经以 `/v1` 结尾，就保持原样；adapter 会在该 base 之下追加 "
"`/chat/completions`。"

#: ../developer/add-local-model.md:437
msgid ""
"Set `supports_tools` and `supports_structured_output` only when the local"
" runtime actually supports them."
msgstr "只有在本地运行时确实支持时，才设置 `supports_tools` 和 `supports_structured_output`。"

